@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = 

# Log in using auth.http, then paste data.accessToken into @token above.
# All book requests require Authorization: Bearer <token>.
# Successful searches require the Google Books provider to be available.

### Search all fields - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?query=Colombia
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search by title - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?query=One%20Hundred%20Years%20of%20Solitude&field=title
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search by author - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?query=Gabriel%20Garcia%20Marquez&field=author
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search by subject - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?query=History&field=subject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search by ISBN - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?query=9780060883287&field=isbn
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### First page - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?query=Colombia&limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Next page - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?query=Colombia&limit=10&offset=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing token - 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?query=Colombia

### Invalid token - 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?query=Colombia
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token

### Missing search query - 400 (requires a valid token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unsupported search field - 400 (requires a valid token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?query=Colombia&field=invalid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Page size above the maximum of 40 - 400 (requires a valid token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?query=Colombia&limit=41
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Negative offset - 400 (requires a valid token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?query=Colombia&offset=-1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
